{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 1362070,
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "39836086",
      "title": "Tailwind: Media Queries & Pseudo Selectors",
      "sourceHash": "e2f276b4003e49bc1f8ce90f48e3cdfdacdc3ac3d71e8785e3c4d5ed38bc3381",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.72,
          "end": 2.6,
          "en": "But before we'll take a closer look",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.6,
          "end": 6.754,
          "en": "at the advantages and disadvantages of Tailwind CSS,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.754,
          "end": 11.04,
          "en": "let's first explore another very important styling problem",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 11.04,
          "end": 13.29,
          "en": "you frequently face.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.29,
          "end": 15.36,
          "en": "What if you need different styles",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.36,
          "end": 17.246,
          "en": "for different screen sizes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.246,
          "end": 20.28,
          "en": "or if you want style pseudo selectors,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.28,
          "end": 23.163,
          "en": "like we added here in the button for the hover style?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 24.57,
          "end": 26.733,
          "en": "Well, let's start with media queries.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 27.96,
          "end": 31.14,
          "en": "Of course, Tailwind has a solution for that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 31.14,
          "end": 32.52,
          "en": "In the official docs,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 32.52,
          "end": 34.77,
          "en": "under responsive design,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 34.77,
          "end": 39.12,
          "en": "you learn that there are certain prefixes you can add",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 39.12,
          "end": 42.408,
          "en": "to your utility classes to only apply them",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 42.408,
          "end": 45.326,
          "en": "if you have a certain minimum screen width.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 45.326,
          "end": 48.84,
          "en": "For example, if you add MD colon",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 48.84,
          "end": 50.88,
          "en": "in front of this width class,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 50.88,
          "end": 53.323,
          "en": "this width class will only be applied",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 53.323,
          "end": 57.03,
          "en": "if you are at least on a medium sized screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 57.03,
          "end": 59.103,
          "en": "with this minimum width.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 61.068,
          "end": 65.13,
          "en": "And therefore translated to our application here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 65.13,
          "end": 67.95,
          "en": "where I have these special styles",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 67.95,
          "end": 70.113,
          "en": "for my header and the h1 element,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 71.08,
          "end": 74.58,
          "en": "I can go back to Header JSX and for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 74.58,
          "end": 78.42,
          "en": "make sure that on this header we only have this huge margin",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 78.42,
          "end": 82.11,
          "en": "to the bottom if we have at least a medium sized screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 82.11,
          "end": 85.023,
          "en": "by prefixing this with MD colon.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 87.21000000000001,
          "end": 89.55,
          "en": "And now I can set up a default margin",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 89.55,
          "end": 93.761,
          "en": "to the bottom of, let's say, two REM with MB 8.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 93.761,
          "end": 96.49799999999999,
          "en": "Now this will always be applied",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 96.49799999999999,
          "end": 99.27000000000001,
          "en": "and this will be applied instead",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 99.27000000000001,
          "end": 101.043,
          "en": "if we have that bigger screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 102.053,
          "end": 105.75,
          "en": "And the same can be done here for the h1 element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 105.75,
          "end": 107.52000000000001,
          "en": "We can use this big text",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 107.52000000000001,
          "end": 110.282,
          "en": "if we have at least a medium sized screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 110.282,
          "end": 114.96000000000001,
          "en": "Otherwise, we could apply the text xl utility clause,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 114.96000000000001,
          "end": 117.27000000000001,
          "en": "which still sets up a large text",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 117.27000000000001,
          "end": 120.903,
          "en": "but not as large as it is with text for xl.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 122.144,
          "end": 126.21,
          "en": "And therefore if I save this, it looks exactly as before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 126.21,
          "end": 129.81,
          "en": "but if I shrink my screen, you see the text gets smaller",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 129.81,
          "end": 132.99,
          "en": "and the margin here below the header also got smaller",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 132.99,
          "end": 134.973,
          "en": "than it is on bigger screens.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 136.236,
          "end": 139.503,
          "en": "Now what about hover styles though?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 140.34,
          "end": 143.403,
          "en": "Well, for this, let's go back to this button here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 144.478,
          "end": 146.37,
          "en": "And of course here at the moment,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 146.37,
          "end": 148.05,
          "en": "I'm using a styled component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 148.05,
          "end": 150.9,
          "en": "and that's not one I want to use anymore.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 150.9,
          "end": 153.18,
          "en": "So I will actually clear this file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 153.18,
          "end": 157.63,
          "en": "and instead export a button component function here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 159.15,
          "end": 161.911,
          "en": "where I return a standard button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 161.911,
          "end": 164.73,
          "en": "and where I use the children prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 164.73,
          "end": 167.91,
          "en": "so that my own button can be wrapped around content",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 167.91,
          "end": 170.233,
          "en": "that should then go in here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 170.233,
          "end": 175.233,
          "en": "and I'll collect any remaining props here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 175.546,
          "end": 180.546,
          "en": "and simply forward them to this button here, like that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 180.832,
          "end": 185.58,
          "en": "But with that, of course, we're not using Tailwind yet.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 185.58,
          "end": 188.61,
          "en": "Instead that can now be done by again adding class name",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 188.61,
          "end": 191.583,
          "en": "and then adding all the classes we want to have here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 193.02,
          "end": 195.47,
          "en": "And for this button, that means that I want",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 195.47,
          "end": 197.61,
          "en": "to have some padding to the left and right,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 197.61,
          "end": 200.52,
          "en": "which can be set with the PX clause here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 200.52,
          "end": 203.668,
          "en": "maybe one REM with PX four.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 203.668,
          "end": 206.19,
          "en": "Then I'm padding to the top at bottom,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 206.19,
          "end": 210.148,
          "en": "maybe PY two for 0.5 rem.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 210.148,
          "end": 213.42000000000002,
          "en": "I wanna have a semi bold font here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 213.42000000000002,
          "end": 216.723,
          "en": "let's say, it should be all uppercase, let's say.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 217.59,
          "end": 219.153,
          "en": "I wanna have some rounded corners",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 219.153,
          "end": 221.57999999999998,
          "en": "by adding the rounded utility class",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 221.57999999999998,
          "end": 223.68,
          "en": "or one of these other rounded classes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 223.68,
          "end": 225.63,
          "en": "to control the border radius",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 225.63,
          "end": 227.913,
          "en": "as you can see here on the right.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 228.815,
          "end": 233.815,
          "en": "But I'll go for rounded and then I'll give this text color",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 234.743,
          "end": 239.743,
          "en": "of text stone 900, which is a dark gray,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 239.833,
          "end": 244.833,
          "en": "BG amber 400 to use this yellow orange-ish background color.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 248.76,
          "end": 250.02,
          "en": "And to now make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 250.02,
          "end": 252.57,
          "en": "that we got a different style when we hover",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 252.57,
          "end": 256.248,
          "en": "over this button, I'll add hover colon",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 256.248,
          "end": 258.75,
          "en": "in front of the utility class",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 258.75,
          "end": 260.49,
          "en": "that should only be applied",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 260.49,
          "end": 262.47,
          "en": "if the button is in a hover state.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 262.47,
          "end": 265.233,
          "en": "So if we are hovering over that button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 266.82,
          "end": 271.432,
          "en": "So just as we can use MD and other screen size classes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 271.432,
          "end": 274.44,
          "en": "to add certain utility classes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 274.44,
          "end": 276.72,
          "en": "only on certain screen sizes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 276.72,
          "end": 280.26,
          "en": "we can use hover or focus colon",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 280.26,
          "end": 283.35,
          "en": "to only apply certain utility classes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 283.35,
          "end": 286.29,
          "en": "if these elements are in a certain state,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 286.29,
          "end": 289.023,
          "en": "in this case, if we're hovering over this button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 290.25,
          "end": 293.49,
          "en": "And then here we can add BG amber 500",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 293.49,
          "end": 295.353,
          "en": "as a background color, let's say,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 296.37,
          "end": 299.13,
          "en": "so that we use this darker background color",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 299.13,
          "end": 301.533,
          "en": "if we are hovering over this button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 302.468,
          "end": 306.63,
          "en": "With that, we again got a pretty long class list here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 306.63,
          "end": 310.465,
          "en": "but with that, if I save this, you see this button,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 310.465,
          "end": 314.31,
          "en": "the regular background color is a bit hard to see right now",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 314.31,
          "end": 317.19,
          "en": "because this input area has no background.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 317.19,
          "end": 318.36,
          "en": "But if I hover over it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 318.36,
          "end": 320.853,
          "en": "you can clearly see that this changes.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}